a pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Dev Plaque</b> is an plaque that shows an Oaklands developer whit unique nummber.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Oaklands Developer on plaque are randomized.</li>\n<li>Nummber on plaque is unique and shows how rare is your plaque.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p>To get <b>Dev Plaque</b> you must have 5 login tokens. To get login tokens you must \n</p><p>claim <a href=\"/wiki/Daily_Rewards\" title=\"Daily Rewards\">daily rewards</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163153\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 51/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019438/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   21.651      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   21.651      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4714-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163153 and revision id 20607. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Daily Rewards","exists":true}],"images":["?"]}
